&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10358&quot; title=&quot;thin python: put collections have no data type specification&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-10358&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-10358&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Make `is_hinted` more specific to avoid potential collision with Complex objects.&lt;/p&gt;

